/* Source carrier S(u,v)=(30u-5,3v,0), u in [0.1,0.3], v in [-1,3].
   Its interior knot 0.2 prevents a common exact source/native U affine map.
   LINE P=(0.1,11), raw D=(0,-4) lies EXACTLY on the original clamped U boundary.
   q=[2,3] gives native tau=[0,1], C(tau)=(-2,9-12tau,0).
   The clamped boundary curve is independent of interior U knots.
   A=(-2,9), B=(-2,-3), C=(4,9) bounds the same analytic 36 mm^2 triangle. */
